---
import { DOCS_URL } from "../lib/site";
---
<section class="m-section" id="assistants" aria-labelledby="ai-title"><div class="m-split">
 <div><div class="m-eyebrow">A second pair of eyes</div><h2 class="m-title" id="ai-title">Help with the words.<br/><em>You keep the voice.</em></h2><p class="m-copy">Get past the blank page, sharpen a search description, or find an article worth linking. Writing, SEO and linking assistants work with your blog content and bring back suggestions to review.</p><div class="ai-profiles"><p><strong>Writing</strong><span>Outlines, rewrites, proofreading and summaries.</span></p><p><strong>SEO</strong><span>Metadata suggestions and clearer explanations of findings.</span></p><p><strong>Linking</strong><span>Relevant articles, useful anchors and healthier references.</span></p></div><div class="m-actions"><a class="m-link" href={DOCS_URL+"/docs/agents"}>Meet the publishing assistants</a></div></div>
 <div class="m-shell"><div class="m-panel ai-example"><div class="proposal-top"><span>SEO assistant</span><span>Example suggestion</span></div><div class="proposal-body"><div class="proposal-label">Search description</div><div class="before"><span>Current</span><p>Notes about building our first product.</p></div><div class="after"><span>Suggested</span><p>What we learned building our first product: the decisions, trade-offs and small improvements that made a difference.</p></div><div class="proposal-review"><span>Review selected changes</span><span class="review-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span></div><p class="m-small">Accepted suggestions become a private draft. You choose when to publish.</p></div></div></div>
</div></section>
<style>.ai-profiles{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:28px}.ai-profiles p{display:grid;grid-template-columns:65px 1fr;gap:20px;font-size:.9rem}.ai-profiles strong{font-weight:500}.ai-profiles span{color:var(--text-muted)}.proposal-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:22px 26px;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)}.proposal-top>span:first-child{color:var(--text)}.proposal-body{padding:30px}.proposal-label{font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:24px}.before,.after{padding:20px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--bg);margin-bottom:15px}.before>span,.after>span{font:400 .68rem var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--text-muted)}.before p,.after p{font-size:.92rem;margin-top:10px}.before p{color:var(--text-muted)}.after{background:rgba(232,255,71,.045);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(232,255,71,.1)}.after>span{color:var(--accent)}.proposal-review{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0 24px;font-size:.85rem}.review-check{color:var(--accent)}@media(max-width:480px){.proposal-body{padding:22px}.proposal-top{padding:20px}.ai-profiles p{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3px}}</style>
